          "location": "plantation-gate",
          "items": [
            "driftwood"
          ]
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "round": 4,
          "text": "The rider drank, thanked the lady ceremoniously, bowed to her husband and rode away; an hour later, after nightfall, he passed the plantation again, going north.",
