        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "round": 3,
          "text": "Farquhar watched the swirling water and a piece of driftwood going by, then closed his eyes to think of his wife and children, and heard a slow ringing like a hammer on an anvil that was the ticking of his watch.",
