        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "round": 6,
          "text": "In the instant he fell, Farquhar's mind lived a long vision in which the rope broke, he fell into the stream, freed his hands underwater, tore away the noose and swam to the surface, his senses preternaturally keen.",
