          "location": "bridge-platform"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "round": 7,
          "text": "In the vision the soldiers on the bridge shouted, the sentinels fired and missed, the lieutenant ordered a volley and the cannon fired; Farquhar dived and swam downstream until a vortex threw him on the south bank.",
