          ],
          "location": "bridge-platform"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "round": 8,
          "text": "In the vision Farquhar ran into the forest and traveled all day and into the night along a straight, untraveled road under unfamiliar stars, with a swollen neck and thirst, hearing whispers.",
